WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:05.460
It’s been said that knowledge is power,
and when it comes to SCP-2440, that might

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.410
really be the case.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:13.050
Like many of the anomalies and entities that
have been kept on file by the SCP Foundation,

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:19.580
SCP-2440 - the being known as The Sealed King
- is a malicious creature of untold, devastating

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.580
power.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.840
The key word there is “untold”, and we
mean it in the most literal sense: You cannot

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.430
know about SCP-2440, it must remain untold.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.679
Unless, of course, you have at least Level
4 clearance.

00:00:33.679 --> 00:00:36.579
You do have the right level of clearance,
don’t you?

00:00:36.579 --> 00:00:40.000
We really would hate to have to break out
the amnestics and wipe your memory at the

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.350
end of this video.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:48.039
Assuming that you do have adequate clearance,
then it is time to introduce you to SCP-2440,

00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:53.800
known to some as The Sealed King, or Xiolt-la
to its friends - if it had any friends that

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.800
is.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.909
If you are familiar with the likes of the
infamous Hanged King or the even more infamous

00:00:58.909 --> 00:01:04.309
Scarlet King, then you will have heard the
term “eldritch being” thrown around before.

00:01:04.309 --> 00:01:09.920
An eldritch abomination is an almost godlike
entity, one which does not adhere to the natural

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:12.960
laws of the universe as we understand them.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:18.229
Their disturbing otherworldliness is almost
indescribable to any mortal person.

00:01:18.229 --> 00:01:24.740
It is a description that can be easily used
to define SCP-2440, along with the words “Keter

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:28.630
Class Anomaly” and “existentially terrifying.”

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:33.869
The Sealed King is an extra dimensional entity,
a being that inhabits a plain of existence

00:01:33.869 --> 00:01:37.369
far outside the physical reality of our own
universe.

00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:42.500
While the creature’s physical appearance
has yet to be observed by any in this dimension,

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.479
some have depicted it as resembling a gigantic
being with a mass of squid-like tentacles,

00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:50.869
along with a glowing humanoid form in its
center.

00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:57.009
What makes SCP-2440 such a formidable threat,
however, is not just the creature’s immense

00:01:57.009 --> 00:01:58.009
size.

00:01:58.009 --> 00:02:03.060
One of SCP-2440’s core abilities is the
power to influence and manipulate the minds

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.670
of mortal beings.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.920
But this isn’t as simple as The Sealed King
choosing one person from our universe and

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.190
driving them like a remote controlled car.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.569
SCP-2440’s influence is spread memetically.

00:02:15.569 --> 00:02:22.760
By manipulating data and information, SCP-2440
slips its memetic agents into texts, images,

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:26.190
even spoken phrases and other audio stimuli.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.599
Think of it like subliminal messaging, or
product placement.

00:02:29.599 --> 00:02:34.030
Imagine for a moment that you see a character
on a TV show eating a certain brand of black

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:37.980
and white sandwich cookie, and that makes
you decide that you want to go to the store

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:42.980
and buy some delicious black and white sandwich
cookies to enjoy for yourself.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:48.750
That idea was planted in your head by something
you saw, and it had an influence on your behavior.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:55.520
SCP-2440 operates on a very similar principle,
but with one key difference.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:03:02.260
Once enough people become aware of it, SCP-2440
will use those to subtly spread its influence,

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.769
controlling the actions of those it manages
to infect, and its hold becomes stronger the

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:10.599
further they spread the knowledge of The Sealed
King.

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:15.299
To put it plainly, the more people that become
aware of The Sealed King’s existence, the

00:03:15.299 --> 00:03:18.640
more powerful this eldritch abomination becomes.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:23.549
The range and scope of SCP-2440’s abilities
varies depending on the quantity of people

00:03:23.549 --> 00:03:26.590
its influence has been memetically spread
to.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:31.549
According to research by the SCP Foundation,
if two hundred people or less have been infected,

00:03:31.549 --> 00:03:36.000
then these individuals will demonstrate an
increased interest in media belonging to the

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.620
horror, science fiction or fantasy genres,
whether this be films, books or images that

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:44.010
fall into one of these categories.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:49.310
Exposure to these desired materials is believed
to increase the spread of The Sealed King’s

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.310
influence.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:56.939
If the number of infected individuals climbs
to between 201 and 500 people, then SCP-2440

00:03:56.939 --> 00:04:01.280
has been known to take direct control of a
single infected person.

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:05.969
This control is somewhat limited though, with
The Sealed King only able to maintain a connection

00:04:05.969 --> 00:04:08.620
with the controlled host for half an hour.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:12.860
During this time, the infected person will
attempt to infect further people by creating

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:17.760
works that contain subtle details about the
nature of SCP-2440.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:23.020
Historically, when infection levels have reached
this phase, Foundation researchers have been

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:27.930
able to communicate with SCP-2440 through
conversation with its host.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:32.460
The creature displays a very hostile attitude
towards humanity, and has been quite open

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.940
with the fact that its sole purpose is to
continue infecting individuals until it is

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:42.090
able to manifest physically in our reality
without the need for a host, something that

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.940
feels like it’s right out of the evil eldritch
entity playbook.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:51.210
When infection of that knowledge spreads to
up to 1,500 people, SCP-2440 becomes able

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:56.940
to take full control of another infected individual,
without the previous limitations.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:01.440
By making them fully subservient, it will
then use this person to speak simultaneously

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:06.419
to any and all that have been infected with
information regarding The Sealed King.

00:05:06.419 --> 00:05:12.690
Next, if up to 10,000 people become infected,
more of SCP-2440’s abilities start to influence

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:13.970
this dimension.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:18.080
The creature is known to be able to distort
and reshape reality, though at this point

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.770
SCP-2440 still needs to control a host.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:26.270
But even though its powers and abilities have
increased, at this stage the creature shows

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:31.570
no interest in actually using them, and its
focus still remains on using its human host

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:35.630
to spread its memetic agents, furthering the
infection.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:40.830
Once the number of people infected by SCP-2440
through subliminal, memetic information surpasses

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:46.560
ten thousand, The Sealed King is able to manifest
its true form outside of a human host, for

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.039
a maximum time frame of one hour.

00:05:50.039 --> 00:05:57.660
This is the point of no return, as SCP-2440’s
reality bending powers are dramatically increased.

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:01.810
The methods that would have previously kept
the creature at bay will cease to be effective

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:07.389
and it can take direct control of up to one
thousand of those it has infected.

00:06:07.389 --> 00:06:13.110
Normally, the SCP Foundation limits the number
of people permitted to know about SCP-2440

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.440
to one hundred cleared personnel.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.770
This is achieved through the use of amnestics.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:23.039
Given that SCP-2440 is a creature that grows
stronger the more people know about it, these

00:06:23.039 --> 00:06:27.650
drugs certainly seem like a viable way of
keeping that number nice and low.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.960
But once infection numbers reach ten thousand?

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:34.069
That’s when amnestics are just no longer
enough.

00:06:34.069 --> 00:06:38.500
Based on the information about The Sealed
King that is available to them, SCP Foundation

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:43.850
personnel have projected that if the number
of people infected by SCP-2440 ever reached

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:49.550
as high as 100,000 or more, the creature would
likely be able to manifest outside a host

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.110
for longer, possibly up to two hours.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:58.610
It is also believed that SCP-2440 would be
capable of creating dimensional portals, either

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:03.780
inviting anomalies from other universes into
our own, or simply creating its own anomalous

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:04.990
creatures.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:11.000
By this point, any and all infected individuals
would be fully under The Sealed King’s control.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:17.550
Finally, if a million people were to become
infected, SCP-2440 would most likely achieve

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.180
its ultimate goal.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:24.620
The eldritch creature would be able to fully
and permanently manifest itself in our dimension,

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:30.250
in its true form, most likely leading to an
XK Class End of the World Scenario.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:35.539
Fortunately, through the dispensing of amnestics,
the SCP Foundations have managed to prevent

00:07:35.539 --> 00:07:38.140
such a scenario from coming to pass.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:42.500
Additionally, containment teams are regularly
sent to investigate any reported awareness

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:49.250
of SCP-2440, and any infected individuals
are either treated with memory-altering drugs,

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.340
or simply terminated.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.909
The entity has been known to spread its influence
through text too though, and even the documents

00:07:55.909 --> 00:07:59.220
within the SCP Foundation’s archives aren’t
safe.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:03.889
The Foundation attempts to keep any links
to The Sealed King within other SCP files

00:08:03.889 --> 00:08:09.410
hidden to avoid a spread of knowledge about
this extra dimensional eldritch abomination.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:16.960
However, while only a hundred members of authorized
SCP personnel are aware of SCP-2440, the Foundation

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:20.680
isn’t the only organization aware of this
being’s existence.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:25.720
A group calling themselves the “Children
of God” is comprised of individuals previously

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:31.599
infected with the knowledge of SCP-2440’s
existence, and has supposedly been around

00:08:31.599 --> 00:08:34.710
even longer than the Foundation has.

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:39.051
These people worship The Sealed King as a
deity, and seek to infect others with the

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:43.170
same information that the creature uses to
influence them.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:47.540
Carrying out the whims of this extra dimensional
threat, the Children of God attempt to “spread

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:52.300
the word” as it were, by any means available
to them.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:56.470
The Foundation considers any member of the
Children of God to be highly dangerous and

00:08:56.470 --> 00:09:01.380
containment teams are advised to either capture
them on sight, or use lethal force to terminate

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.380
them.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:06.640
The Children of God were previously based
in a compound somewhere in the United States

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.410
and during an assault on their base, the Foundation
was able to recover documents that described

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:15.460
the possible origin of SCP-2440.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:20.310
According to these documents, at the very
dawn of time, old gods emerged from an empty

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:24.760
abyss of nothingness, otherwise referred to
as Mother Void.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:30.250
This entity granted life across the universe,
all other realities and every conceivable

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.250
dimension.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:35.090
However, the story detailed in the Children
of God’s legend claims that the old gods

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:40.090
were “fickle, twisted, and brutal things”
with “no purity in them”.

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:46.090
It seems to suggest that the old gods were
similar entities to SCP-2440, capable of bending

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:51.030
and reshaping reality, and apparently did
so purely for their own amusement within the

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.240
newly-created universe.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:57.880
These old gods created creatures in their
own image, toying with the fabric of reality

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:02.080
like children with blocks, building and destroying
at will.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:06.400
Before long, the old gods began to turn on
each other, focusing their natural jealousy

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.440
on their siblings that had been born of the
void.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:14.630
The firstborn of the Void and Chaos, a being
called Ma’tol, coveted the creations of

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:20.370
his fellow old gods, and flooded the newly
created worlds with a rampaging army of vile,

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.660
grotesque beasts he had made.

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:27.070
As Ma’tol attempted to kill his various
siblings, the other old gods retaliated and

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:31.930
sent the universe into a period of darkness
where “the blood of young life flowed like

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:32.930
water.”

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:38.320
However, none of the old gods could ever die,
only be forgotten, but they had created so

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:43.830
many creatures to serve them and fulfil their
purposes that it seemed impossible this would

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.150
ever happen.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:51.810
The Children of God’s documents then describe
Xiolt-la, or SCP-2440 as he is otherwise known.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:57.340
Apparently the first born of Mother Void and
an entity called Father Light, SCP-2440 is

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:03.090
also referred to by many reverent titles such
as Lord of the Gods, Devourer of the Impure

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:05.440
and Savior of Life.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:09.730
Being born of both light and the darkness
of the void, Xiolt-la was considered to be

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:15.020
a true god, and according to the creature’s
followers, did not set about creating life,

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.570
but perfecting it.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:20.800
The old gods turned on Xiolt-la, his half
siblings attacking him with the armies and

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.180
monstrosities they had created.

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:29.120
However, some of these creatures turned on
their masters in service of SCP-2440 instead.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:35.790
After generations of warfare between SCP-2440
and the old gods, Xiolt-la finally vanquished

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:41.550
Ma’tol in single combat that lasted ten
thousand years and laid waste to countless

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.660
worlds, almost tearing the universe apart.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:49.440
Eventually prevailing, Xiolt-la cast his siblings
down into oblivion.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:55.740
But as he did so, Ma’tol cursed him, banishing
SCP-2440 from the universe, implied in these

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:59.230
documents to have been our very own reality.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.410
The Children of God venerate the creature
as their lord and savior, with more of their

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:08.410
documents claiming that this “king of all
mankind” is wrongfully sealed away.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:13.390
They believe their Sealed King is returning,
destined to reappear in this dimension and

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.800
lay waste to our reality.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:21.860
Whether this is truly the origin of SCP-2440,
or just what the entity wishes its infected

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.810
disciples to believe is unclear.

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:30.920
Whatever the case, we suggest you quickly
forget everything you know about SCP-2440

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.530
for your own safety.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:39.120
Now check out “SCP-001 - The Scarlet King”
and “SCP-2845 - Alien God Crash Lands On

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:43.480
Our Planet - The Deer” for more entities
that could destroy everything we know and

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.830
love in a heartbeat.

